# LF in the repository. Windows-only scripts are checked out (and archived) with CRLF, which cmd.exe,
# Windows PowerShell 5.1 and Inno Setup expect.
* text=auto
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.iss text eol=crlf

*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.onnx binary
*.tflite binary
